  <explanation>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Data exchange with 1C:Enterprise Accounting application is used.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>تبادل داده با برنامه 1C:Enterprise Accounting استفاده می‌شود.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Viene utilizzato lo scambio dati con configurazione &quot;1C:Enterprise Accounting&quot;.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Jest używana wymiana danych z konfiguracją &quot;1C:Enterprise Accounting&quot;.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Используется обмен данными с конфигурацией &quot;Бухгалтерия предприятия&quot;.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>&quot;İşletme Muhasebesi&quot; konfigürasyonu ile veri alışverişi kullanılmaktadır.</value>
